desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Spring Actuator Fully Enabled"
	title_zh: "Spring Actuator Fully Enabled"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-spring-actuator-fully-enabled"
	risk: "information-exposure"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Spring Boot Actuator is fully enabled. This exposes sensitive endpoints such as /actuator/env, /actuator/logfile, /actuator/heapdump and others. Unless you have Spring Security enabled or another means to protect these endpoints, this functionality is available without authentication, causing a significant security risk.

### 风险类型
敏感信息泄露（information-exposure）

### 影响
应用可能暴露内部路径、环境信息或敏感数据，攻击者可借此收集攻击面。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-200: Exposure of Sensitive Information to an Unauthorized Actor
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
限制敏感信息的输出范围，关闭不必要的调试接口，并对暴露内容进行脱敏。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.properties": <<<POS
management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=*
POS
	"safefile://pos.properties": <<<NEG
management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=health
NEG
)

${*.properties}.pattern_regex(/(?:management\.endpoints\.web\.exposure\.include=\*)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Spring Actuator Fully Enabled",
	title_zh: "Spring Actuator Fully Enabled",
	message: "Spring Actuator Fully Enabled detected.",
}
